          <h4>Which Guarantee Would an Avian Vet Tell You to Trust?</h4>
          <p>The one that sends you to them. Every veterinary recommendation on buying a bird converges on the same instruction — have an independent avian vet examine your new parrot promptly — and a guarantee built around that instruction is the only kind a vet can actually help you enforce.</p>
        </section>

