          <h5>Each Grey Below Ships Vet-Checked, DNA-Sexed and Papered</h5>
          <p>The examination, the PCR panel and the sexing assay are all complete before a bird is listed, and the certificates are issued against the closed band number rather than the name. That ordering matters: a certificate written against a name proves a bird was tested, while one written against a band proves <em>this</em> bird was.</p>

